  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组是 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot Integrations</a> 的扩展，为</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hoponopono/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hopo's</a> 的结构增加了战利品：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hopo-better-mineshaft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hopo Better Mineshaft</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hopo-better-ruined-portals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hopo Better Ruined Portals</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hopo-better-underwater-ruins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hopo Better Underwater Ruins</a></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">战利品将拥有更多变化，并选自可比的原始战利品表，这些战利品表也包含模组物品，以兼容所有添加战利品的模组。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">仅需服务端安装，无需所有模组同时存在。</span><br><img style=\"font-size:18px\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">目前已知无兼容性问题，应能与任何其他模组共存。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p>如果您喜欢这个模组，请考虑支持开发，任何支持都深表感谢。</p><p>开发是无偿的业余活动，因此任何支持都有助于投入更多时间进行开发。<br>您可以通过 Patreon 支持我，或只是帮助传播。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
